# SE-EDU Git conventions

All commits in this project MUST follow the SE-EDU Git conventions.

When proposing or creating a commit, writing a commit message, or naming a branch:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/seedu-git-standard/SKILL.md`.
2. Apply every subject, body, and branch-name rule in that skill.

Do not skip this skill for Git work in this repository.
Still do not commit or push unless the user explicitly asks.
